N1  - <p>BOINC criterion evidence - Acknowledgments, verbatim: "We gratefully acknowledge all the contributors of computer time to the E ON BOINC project." Section on BOINC, verbatim: "E ON supports distributed computing using the Berkeley Open Infrastructure for Network Computing (BOINC). Running a distributed calculation requires a BOINC project server and an E ON client that is linked with the BOINC library. E ON is currently run as a BOINC project with over a thousand computers connected that has achieved a peak performance of four teraFLOPS." | Full text: Modelling Simul. Mater. Sci. Eng. 22(5):055002 (2014) | Link: EOn / BOINC | Source: MSMSE (2014)ER&nbsp;&nbsp;-</p>
